Begin3
Title:          Memory Map
Version:        3.0
Entered-date:   2002-10-09
Description:    program to display the memory map
Summary:        Map is a program to display the memory map. It can list only programs and device drivers, or the full list of memory control blocks. It can also list device drivers, interrupt vectors and the high memory area (HMA). It is based on Map 2.0 by Peter Sulyok. It requires DOS 5+ and a 386+.
Keywords:       dos 16 bit edit command
Author:         Sulyok Peter
Maintained-by:  Jason Hood
Primary-site:   http://adoxa.altervista.org/map/
Platforms:      DOS
Copying-policy: Free w/sources
Modified-date: 2021-11-16.0
end
